Description: Deep learning for humans (legacy Keras 2, TF backend)
 TF-Keras is the legacy Keras 2 API, kept as a standalone package now
 that Keras 3 (python3-keras) is TensorFlow's default. Some libraries,
 such as opennsfw2, still depend on this TF-bundled Keras 2 API.
 .
 Packaged as an opennsfw2 dependency for the invokeai-mastodon
 project's local NSFW image classification.
